# Cache headers (BUILD-PLAN.md §8, WP7): short TTL on HTML so content updates show up quickly,
# long + immutable on fingerprinted build assets (filenames are content-hashed by Vite, so a
# changed file always gets a new URL — safe to cache forever). Cloudflare applies every matching
# block and lets a later block override an earlier one's same header, so the specific overrides
# below win over the default.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
